🔐 Why Policy as Code?
✅ Prevent privilege escalation
✅ Block unapproved images
✅ Enforce resource limits
✅ Require labels, annotations, or team tags

Policies are written in Rego and enforced at admission time — no manual policing needed.

⚙️ GitOps + OPA Workflow:
Define policies in Git (Rego + Constraints)

Deploy via ArgoCD (like any other CRDs)

Violations appear in ArgoCD as Not Synced

Teams fix in Git → ArgoCD syncs → ✅ Clean deploy

